{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d16ebb44-c7f7-85bb-8f33-57f707f9960e",
  "created_at": "2025-12-21T09:20:16-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Aisha Kim",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T09:17:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T09:17:10-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. Please excuse me for calling on a Sunday, I know City Hall is closed today, but this is the number I was given for the storm problems."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T09:17:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you're good, that's what this line is for. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T09:17:26-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Please, let me explain. I live at 286 Broadway, in the North End. After the soaker from Wednesday into Thursday, three days ago, the water came again into my yard. It runs down the hill from the next street and goes straight into the yard, like a little river."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T09:17:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 286 Broadway. And it comes down from the street above you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T09:17:50-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. From the next street, down the hill. It happens every time it rains hard, and nobody comes to fix it. I am very tired of this, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T09:18:01-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I hear you. So I'm putting down runoff coming downhill into the yard at 286 Broadway, after the Wednesday-Thursday storm. Is it getting into the house at all, or just the yard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T09:18:14-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Only the yard this time, but it was up to the steps. Please understand, it is the same thing again and again. [pause] I took photos, many photos. If you give me a place, I can send them to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T09:18:29-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, that helps. Let me note that you have photos. I don't have an email I can read you off the top of my head, so I'll have the office follow up with you on how to send them. Is this the best number, the one you're calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T09:18:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please use this one, 401-555-0156. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T09:18:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0156. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T09:18:54-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Aisha Kim. K-I-M."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T09:18:56-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Aisha Kim. Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T09:18:58-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please, one more question. Do the crews work on weekends? Because if it rains again, I want to know if somebody can come, not only on Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T09:19:08-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After a big storm they do get out, but they're stretched thin and they go to the worst spots first. I'll flag yours so it's on the list for the drains up the hill to be looked at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T09:19:22-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I hope so. Excuse me, I am a little upset, it is not because of you. Even my neighbor, he borrowed my ladder in October and still has not returned it, so today everything is annoying me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T09:19:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that one I can't help you with. Hope he brings it back soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T09:19:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Me too. Please, when somebody calls me, can they tell me what they will do? Not just that they wrote it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T09:19:52-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put that in the note. Somebody from the office should call you Monday or Tuesday about the photos and what's planned for that hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T09:20:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you for your time, Kevin. Please, I hope this time it is different."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T09:20:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll do what I can on my end. You have a good Sunday, Ms. Kim."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T09:20:14-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
